  "title": "Ali&#39;s Green Sauce",
  "description": "This creamy sauce - made from fresh avocado, tomatillos, sour cream, and seasonings - is extremely similar to a very well known Mexican restaurant&#39;s sauce. Serve with salsa and tortilla chips. Better double the recipe because this dip goes fast!",
